			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fix/mixin compatibility with kuvalich by @xlxyvergil in https://github.com/xlxyvergil/TaczAttributeAdd/pull/7\n* feat: 添加暴击属性显示，支持增益减益条和多语言配置 by @xlxyvergil in https://github.com/xlxyvergil/TaczAttributeAdd/pull/8\n* feat: 添加服务端配置同步到客户端功能 v1.3.1 by @xlxyvergil in https://github.com/xlxyvergil/TaczAttributeAdd/pull/9\n* feat: 添加KubeJS属性显示事件系统 by @xlxyvergil in https://github.com/xlxyvergil/TaczAttributeAdd/pull/10\n\n## New Contributors\n* @xlxyvergil made their first contribution in https://github.com/xlxyvergil/TaczAttributeAdd/pull/7\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/xlxyvergil/TaczAttributeAdd/compare/1.0.8...v1.4.6-1.20.1"
